{
  "id": "585",
  "title": "Contact and Relation",
  "level": "upper intermediate",
  "date": "2018-10-19",
  "synopsis": "Little Zhang wants help to get in contact with someone at the Great Wall Company.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/869/2ee24d93b4f93eaa59374218fbf8bcb7b151e2ef.mp3?1539496623",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "联系和关系\n\n小张：听说你认识长城公司的黄经理，是吗？\n小何：她是我大学时候的好朋友。怎么了？\n小张：我有个项目想和她合作，可是都联系不上她。你和她关系那么好，能帮我联系一下她吗？\n小何：我们这几年没怎么联系，关系没有那么好了。\n小张：你们的关系再不好，也比我好啦。帮帮忙吧！\n小何：好吧，我试试看。\n（几分钟后）\n小何：奇怪，她不接电话。\n小张：没关系。可能她在忙，等会儿再给她打吧。",
    "traditional": "聯繫和關係\n\n小張：聽說你認識長城公司的黃經理，是嗎？\n小何：她是我大學時候的好朋友。怎麼了？\n小張：我有個項目想和她合作，可是都聯繫不上她。你和她關係那麼好，能幫我聯繫一下她嗎？\n小何：我們這幾年沒怎麼聯繫，關係沒有那麼好了。\n小張：你們的關係再不好，也比我好啦。幫幫忙吧！\n小何：好吧，我試試看。\n（幾分鐘後）\n小何：奇怪，她不接電話。\n小張：沒關係。可能她在忙，等會兒再給她打吧。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Contact and Relation"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小张：听说你认识长城公司的黄经理，是吗？",
      "traditional": "小張：聽說你認識長城公司的黃經理，是嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng tīng shuō nǐ rèn shi cháng chéng gōng sī de huáng jīng lǐ shì ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: I heard that you know manager Huang from the Great Wall Company, is that right?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小何：她是我大学时候的好朋友。怎么了？",
      "traditional": "小何：她是我大學時候的好朋友。怎麼了？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé tā shì wǒ dà xué shí hou de hǎo péng you zěn me le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: She’s my good friend from university. What’s up?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小张：我有个项目想和她合作，可是都联系不上她。",
      "traditional": "小張：我有個項目想和她合作，可是都聯繫不上她。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng wǒ yǒu ge xiàng mù xiǎng hé tā hé zuò kě shì dōu lián xì bú shàng tā",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "你和她关系那么好，能帮我联系一下她吗？",
      "traditional": "你和她關係那麼好，能幫我聯繫一下她嗎？",
      "pinyin": "nǐ hé tā guān xi nà me hǎo néng bāng wǒ lián xì yí xià tā ma",
      "english": "Little Zhang: I have an event I want to collaborate with her on, but I’m unable to contact her."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Since you two have such a good relationship, could you help me contact her?"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "小何：我们这几年没怎么联系，关系没有那么好了。",
      "traditional": "小何：我們這幾年沒怎麼聯繫，關係沒有那麼好了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé wǒ men zhè jǐ nián méi zěn me lián xì guān xi méi yǒu nà me hǎo le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: We haven’t been in contact over the last few years, so our relationship isn’t that great anymore."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "小张：你们的关系再不好，也比我好啦。帮帮忙吧！",
      "traditional": "小張：你們的關係再不好，也比我好啦。幫幫忙吧！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng nǐ men de guān xi zài bù hǎo yě bǐ wǒ hǎo la bāng bang máng ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: Even if your relationship with her isn’t that great, it’s still better than mine. Help me out!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "小何：好吧，我试试看。",
      "traditional": "小何：好吧，我試試看。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé hǎo ba wǒ shì shi kàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Alright, I’ll give it a try."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "（几分钟后）",
      "traditional": "（幾分鐘後）",
      "pinyin": "jǐ fēn zhōng hòu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "(A few minutes later)"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "小何：奇怪，她不接电话。",
      "traditional": "小何：奇怪，她不接電話。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé qí guài tā bù jiē diàn huà",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Strange, she doesn’t answer the phone."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "小张：没关系。可能她在忙，等会儿再给她打吧。",
      "traditional": "小張：沒關係。可能她在忙，等會兒再給她打吧。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng méi guān xi kě néng tā zài máng děng huì'r zài gěi tā dǎ ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: That’s alright. Maybe she’s busy. Try calling her again in a while."
    }
  ],
